  "content": "\n\n<h1>束口袋重量，一次帶四件！</h1>\n<p>在束口袋中只存放單件工具或盔甲配件相當不便。不如讓我們整組存儲一套盔甲或工具 <em>套裝</em>吧！此模組將束口袋的承重係數設為最大堆疊數 1 的 1/4，也就是說你一次可以在束口袋中攜帶四件物品！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/v/1134122?label=latest\" alt=\"CurseForge 最新版本\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/bundlefour\" alt=\"Modrinth 遊戲版本\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/Bundle-Weight-Theres-Four\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上取得\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundlefour\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上取得\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundlefour\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 上取得\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbundlefour%252fversions%253fl%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/1f85027a20670b89b94462ddd345af897b47ac17/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 NeoForge\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fthomasglasser\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/donate/buymeacoffee-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"請我喝杯咖啡\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/tjf7CedM38\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a